<title>SOUTH AFRICA: SAfrica Aug manufacturing output up 0.7 pct y/y.</title>
<headline>SAfrica Aug manufacturing output up 0.7 pct y/y.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African manufacturing production rose 0.7 percent on a seasonally-adjusted basis in August compared with the same month a year ago, the Central Statistical Service (CSS) said.</p>
<p>Month-on-month, seasonally-adjusted manufacturing production was up 1.8.</p>
<p>Index of the physical volume of manufacturing production</p>
<p>(base 1990=100):</p>
<p>				 Aug '96	 Jul '96	Aug '95</p>
<p>    Seasonally adjusted  104.4	   102.6	  103.7</p>
<p>    Actual		   107.5	   104.2	  106.8</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
